From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rumisle <why-excuse-quail@duck.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:18:23 +0800
Subject: app/composer: one-line composer; model, effort and agent in the +
 menu

The composer was a 96px box: the editor, then a bar with +, the model button, the
effort and agent pickers, and send. Now it is a single row, [+] [editor] [send],
that starts one line tall and grows as you type (up to 180px, then scrolls).

Model, effort and agent move to the top of the + menu, each showing its current
value: Model opens the same model dialog as before (or the unpaid dialog), Effort
and Agent are submenus. Agent and Effort only appear when there is a choice.

Ocelot-Patch: web/composer-one-line

